WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 10:1-42 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2611), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-11-18.

1
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.030
After this the Lord appointed seventy-two others

2
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.550
and sent them two by two ahead of him

3
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.750
to every town and place where he was about to go.

4
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.200
He told them, The harvest is plentiful,

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.900
but the workers are few.

6
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.300
Ask the Lord of the harvest, therefore,

7
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.050
to send out workers into his harvest field.

8
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.900
Go! I am sending you out like lambs among wolves.

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.300
Do not take a purse or bag or sandals;

10
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.500
and do not greet anyone on the road.

11
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.700
When you enter a house, first say, Peace to this house.

12
00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.450
If someone who promotes peace is there,

13
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.500
your peace will rest on them;

14
00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:50.400
if not, it will return to you.

15
00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:55.000
Stay there, eating and drinking whatever they give you,

16
00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.300
for the worker deserves his wages.

17
00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:02.750
Do not move around from house to house.

18
00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.100
When you enter a town and are welcomed,

19
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.800
eat what is offered to you.

20
00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:11.700
Heal the sick who are there and tell them,

21
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.450
The kingdom of God has come near to you.

22
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.600
But when you enter a town and are not welcomed,

23
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.100
go into its streets and say,

24
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.360
Even the dust of your town we wipe from our feet

25
00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.550
as a warning to you.

26
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:31.150
Yet be sure of this: The kingdom of God has come near.

27
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:35.650
I tell you, it will be more bearable on that day for Sodom

28
00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:37.100
than for that town.
